<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks decline to 161,740.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks decline to 161,740.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 30 totaled 161,740 bales, off from 161,746 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, four bales awaiting review, six cancellations, and 23,932 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
